1) address+phone are in the preceding page-1 span, while the following span only contains the explanatory telephone label (Amazon 2016/2018, Lockheed).
2) the phone number itself is its own page-1 H2/section_header, with path_text ending in the phone number (Corning, Nike).

I’ll add one targeted rule for page-1 spans under the company header that contain an address and a phone number, and one rule for page-1 H2/section_header spans whose text itself is a phone number.

